<table style="width:100%; border:0;cellspacing:0;cellpadding:0">
  <tr style='padding: 0;border:0'>
    <td style="width: 100%;padding: 0;border:0">
      <table style="max-width:800px;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;">
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:left;padding: 0;border:0">
            <div style='text-align:center;margin-left: auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top: 16px;margin-bottom:0'>
              <%= image_tag 'image-3.png', width: 140 %>
            </div>

            <h1 style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 300; font-size: 44px; margin: 30px auto 70px auto;text-align: center;padding: 0;line-height: 1.15;">
              Reserve your Pickup Today
            </h1>

            <% if @contact.name.present? && @contact.name.downcase != 'no name provided' %>
              <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 0;">
                Hello <%= @contact.name %>,
              </p>
            <% end %>

            <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 0;">
              We hope this message finds you well. As the new year begins, we wanted to remind you that the tree pickup service provided by <%= @setting.organization_name %> is scheduled for <%= @setting.event_pickup_start.strftime('%A, %B %-d') %>.
            </p>

            <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 30px; padding: 0;">
              It appears that you haven't signed up for this year's tree pickup yet, and we didn't want you to miss the opportunity. To ensure a hassle-free experience, please take a moment to register on our website:
            </p>

            <div style='width:70%; text-align:center; margin: 0 auto 30px auto'>
              <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-bottom: 20px">
                <tr>
                  <td style='width:100%'>
                    <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style='width:100%'>
                      <tr>
                        <td style="border-radius: 4px" bgcolor="#ED2939" style='text-align:center; width: 70%'>
                          <a href="<%= root_url(contact_id: @contact.id) %>" target="_blank" style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #ED2939;border-radius: 2px;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px; color: #ffffff !important;text-decoration: none;font-weight:bold;display: inline-block;">
                            Register for a tree pickup
                          </a>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </div>

            <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
              Here's a quick overview of the process:
            </p>

            <ol style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5;font-weight:400; padding-left: 1.2em;margin-bottom: 20px">
              <li>
                <span style="font-weight:800">Register for a Tree Pickup:</span>
                Simply visit our website and complete the registration process.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span style="font-weight:800">Confirmation Email:</span>
                Once registered, you will receive a confirmation email detailing the pickup logistics.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span style="font-weight:800">Scheduled Pickup:</span>
                Our team will be on standby to collect your tree on <%= @setting.event_pickup_start.strftime('%A, %B %-d') %>.
              </li>
            </ol>

            <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 0;">
              Please note that the deadline for reserving a pickup slot is <%= @setting.event_pickup_end.strftime('%A, %B %-d') %>.
            </p>

            <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 0;">
              Your participation not only supports <%= @setting.organization_name %> but also contributes to the environmentally friendly disposal of Christmas trees in our community.
            </p>

            <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 0;">
              Thank you for considering our tree pickup service. We appreciate your support.
            </p>

            <p style="font-family:'SF UI Display Medium',system,-apple-system,-webkit-system-font,'SFNSText','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif !important; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-weight:400; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 60px; padding: 0;">
              Warm regards,<br>
              <%= @setting.organization_name %>
            </p>

            <%= render 'shared/mailer_footer' %>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
